Object.assign(window.__CMPDATA__=window.__CMPDATA__||{},{"duckdb__5": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持——存储格式向后兼容自 v0.10 起是官方目标；格式变化时无原地升级，必须&quot;旧二进制 EXPORT DATABASE + 新二进制 IMPORT DATABASE&quot;（需同时保留两个版本的可执行文件）；回退同理。v1.0–v1.5 默认存储格式 pin 在 v1.0（政策非承诺）；v2.0 将换新默认存储格式。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（st…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p><strong>部分支持</strong>——存储格式向后兼容自 v0.10 起是官方目标；格式变化时无原地升级，必须&quot;旧二进制 EXPORT DATABASE + 新二进制 IMPORT DATABASE&quot;（需同时保留两个版本的可执行文件）；回退同理。v1.0–v1.5 默认存储格式 pin 在 v1.0（政策非承诺）；v2.0 将换新默认存储格式。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（storage）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported — storage-format backward compatibility is an official goal since v0.10; there is no in-place upgrade when the format changes — the only path is old-b…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> — storage-format backward compatibility is an official goal since v0.10; there is no in-place upgrade when the format changes — the only path is old-binary <code>EXPORT DATABASE</code> + new-binary <code>IMPORT DATABASE</code> (both executables must be kept); rollback works the same way. Default storage format pinned at v1.0 for the v1.0–v1.5 line (policy, not a promise); v2.0 introduces a new default storage format. Evidence: official docs (storage).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__6": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持——有：EXPLAIN / EXPLAIN ANALYZE、PRAGMA profiling（json 输出可画火焰图）、duckdb_memory()、pragma_database_size()、duckdb_temporary_files()、duckdb_settings()、duckdb_databases()；查证为无…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p><strong>部分支持</strong>——有：<code>EXPLAIN</code> / <code>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code>、PRAGMA profiling（json 输出可画火焰图）、<code>duckdb_memory()</code>、<code>pragma_database_size()</code>、<code>duckdb_temporary_files()</code>、<code>duckdb_settings()</code>、<code>duckdb_databases()</code>；<strong>查证为无</strong>：慢查询日志、跨会话查询历史（<code>duckdb_queries()</code>/<code>duckdb_connections()</code> 不存在，社区探针 v1.5.5 实测确认）、<code>PRAGMA integrity_check</code>。证据：官方文档 + 社区实测。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported — has EXPLAIN / EXPLAIN ANALYZE, PRAGMA profiling (JSON output, flamegraph-able), duckdb_memory(), pragma_database_size(), duckdb_temporary_files(), d…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> — has <code>EXPLAIN</code> / <code>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code>, PRAGMA profiling (JSON output, flamegraph-able), <code>duckdb_memory()</code>, <code>pragma_database_size()</code>, <code>duckdb_temporary_files()</code>, <code>duckdb_settings()</code>, <code>duckdb_databases()</code>; <strong>verified absent</strong>: slow-query log, cross-session query history (<code>duckdb_queries()</code> / <code>duckdb_connections()</code> don&#x27;t exist, confirmed by a community probe on v1.5.5), <code>PRAGMA integrity_check</code>. Evidence: official docs + community testing.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__7": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——进程内连接，创建开销极低；查询自动用满全部 CPU 核心（SET threads 可调）；无网络往返、无连接池概念（不需要）。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong>——进程内连接，创建开销极低；查询自动用满全部 CPU 核心（<code>SET threads</code> 可调）；无网络往返、无连接池概念（不需要）。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — in-process connections with negligible setup cost; queries automatically use all CPU cores (SET threads adjustable); no network round-trips, no connection poo…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> — in-process connections with negligible setup cost; queries automatically use all CPU cores (<code>SET threads</code> adjustable); no network round-trips, no connection pooling concept (none needed). Evidence: official docs + community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——ACID；为批量优化的 MVCC（借鉴 HyPer），默认快照隔离（Snapshot Isolation）；进程内多线程写走乐观并发：append 永不冲突，并发 update/delete 同一行后者报冲突失败；跨进程只允许&quot;单进程读写&quot;或&quot;多进程只读&quot;，第二进程写会报文件锁错误；无 SAVEPOINT<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong>——ACID；为批量优化的 MVCC（借鉴 HyPer），默认快照隔离（Snapshot Isolation）；进程内多线程写走乐观并发：append 永不冲突，并发 update/delete 同一行后者报冲突失败；跨进程只允许&quot;单进程读写&quot;或&quot;多进程只读&quot;，第二进程写会报文件锁错误；<strong>无 SAVEPOINT</strong><span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（concurrency）+ 社区共识。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — ACID; batch-optimized MVCC (HyPer-inspired), default snapshot isolation; in-process multi-threaded writes use optimistic concurrency: appends never conflict, …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> — ACID; batch-optimized MVCC (HyPer-inspired), default snapshot isolation; in-process multi-threaded writes use optimistic concurrency: appends never conflict, concurrent update/delete of the same row fails the later one; cross-process only allows &quot;single process read-write&quot; or &quot;multiple processes read-only&quot; — a second writer gets a file-lock error; <strong>no SAVEPOINT</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Evidence: official docs (concurrency) + community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__9": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用——单机进程内引擎，无复制协议、无多副本一致性；&quot;多副本&quot; = 文件拷贝；多机协作靠 DuckLake（对象存储 + 元数据）或 MotherDuck；Quack client-server 协议 2026-05 技术预览、beta 中。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p><strong>不适用</strong>——单机进程内引擎，无复制协议、无多副本一致性；&quot;多副本&quot; = 文件拷贝；多机协作靠 DuckLake（对象存储 + 元数据）或 MotherDuck；Quack client-server 协议 2026-05 技术预览、beta 中。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A — single-node</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A — single-node in-process engine, no replication protocol, no multi-copy consistency; &quot;more copies&quot; = file copies; multi-node collaboration via DuckLake (object storag…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A — single-node</span><p><strong>N/A</strong> — single-node in-process engine, no replication protocol, no multi-copy consistency; &quot;more copies&quot; = file copies; multi-node collaboration via DuckLake (object storage + metadata) or MotherDuck; the Quack client-server protocol is in technical preview/beta (May 2026). Evidence: official docs + community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__0": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。所有表默认 AES-256 落盘加密；三档：AWS owned key（默认）、AWS managed key（aws/dynamodb）、customer managed KMS key（自带轮换策略、CloudTrail 审计密钥使用）。注意：AWS owned key 无可见性，合规场景必须显式切 CMK。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。所有表默认 AES-256 落盘加密；三档：AWS owned key（默认）、AWS managed key（<code>aws/dynamodb</code>）、customer managed KMS key（自带轮换策略、CloudTrail 审计密钥使用）。注意：AWS owned key 无可见性，合规场景必须显式切 CMK。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. All tables encrypted on disk with AES-256 by default; three tiers: AWS owned key (default), AWS managed key (aws/dynamodb), customer managed KM…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. All tables encrypted on disk with AES-256 by default; three tiers: AWS owned key (default), AWS managed key (<code>aws/dynamodb</code>), customer managed KMS key (bring your own rotation policy; key usage audited via CloudTrail). Note: AWS owned keys offer no visibility — compliance scenarios must explicitly switch to a CMK.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__1": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。所有 API 走 HTTPS/TLS；SDK 默认；支持 VPC endpoint 私有访问不走公网。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。所有 API 走 HTTPS/TLS；SDK 默认；支持 VPC endpoint 私有访问不走公网。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. All API calls go over HTTPS/TLS; SDK default; VPC endpoints supported for private access without going over the public internet.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. All API calls go over HTTPS/TLS; SDK default; VPC endpoints supported for private access without going over the public internet.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__10": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有，在线</span><p class=\"snippet\">有，在线<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。存储驱动自动分区（无感）；吞吐按 on-demand 自动或 provisioned/auto-scaling 调整；无纵向扩展概念。分区是&quot;只增&quot;逻辑，热 key 无法靠加分区解决（见深水区一）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有，在线</span><p><strong>有，在线</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。存储驱动自动分区（无感）；吞吐按 on-demand 自动或 provisioned/auto-scaling 调整；无纵向扩展概念。分区是&quot;只增&quot;逻辑，热 key 无法靠加分区解决（见深水区一）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported, online <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Storage-driven automatic partitioning (invisible to you); throughput adjusts via on-demand auto or provisioned/auto-scaling; no vertica…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported, online</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Storage-driven automatic partitioning (invisible to you); throughput adjusts via on-demand auto or provisioned/auto-scaling; no vertical-scaling concept. Partitions only ever grow — hot keys can&#x27;t be solved by adding partitions (see Deep-dive 1).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__11": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。专有 NoSQL API（GetItem/PutItem/UpdateItem/DeleteItem/Query/Scan/Batch/Transact）+ PartiQL（SQL 方言子集，功能弱于真 SQL）；AWS SDK 全语言；DynamoDB Local 供本地开发。无 MySQL/PG/Oracle 协…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p><strong>部分支持</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。专有 NoSQL API（GetItem/PutItem/UpdateItem/DeleteItem/Query/Scan/Batch/Transact）+ PartiQL（SQL 方言子集，功能弱于真 SQL）；AWS SDK 全语言；DynamoDB Local 供本地开发。<strong>无</strong> MySQL/PG/Oracle 协议，无开源发行版，迁出=重写数据访问层。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Proprietary NoSQL API (GetItem/PutItem/UpdateItem/DeleteItem/Query/Scan/Batch/Transact) + PartiQL (a SQL-dialect subset, weaker than …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Proprietary NoSQL API (GetItem/PutItem/UpdateItem/DeleteItem/Query/Scan/Batch/Transact) + PartiQL (a SQL-dialect subset, weaker than real SQL); AWS SDKs in all languages; DynamoDB Local for local development. <strong>No</strong> MySQL/PG/Oracle protocol (confirmed absent), no open-source distribution (confirmed absent) — migrating away = rewriting the data-access layer.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__12": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">闭源商业<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></span><p class=\"snippet\">闭源商业<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。按量付费：on-demand 按读写请求单元、provisioned 按 RCU/WCU-小时、存储 GB-月、PITR、备份存储、Global Tables 复制写（rWCU）、Streams 读取、DAX 另计；Standard-IA 表类降存储费。AWS 锁定是最大商业现实：无他云、无自建。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">闭源商业<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></span><p>闭源商业<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。按量付费：on-demand 按读写请求单元、provisioned 按 RCU/WCU-小时、存储 GB-月、PITR、备份存储、Global Tables 复制写（rWCU）、Streams 读取、DAX 另计；Standard-IA 表类降存储费。<strong>AWS 锁定是最大商业现实</strong>：无他云、无自建。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Closed-source comm</span><p class=\"snippet\">Closed-source commercial <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Pay-as-you-go: on-demand billed per read/write request unit, provisioned billed per RCU/WCU-hour, storage GB-month, PITR, backup…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Closed-source comm</span><p>Closed-source commercial <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Pay-as-you-go: on-demand billed per read/write request unit, provisioned billed per RCU/WCU-hour, storage GB-month, PITR, backup storage, Global Tables replicated writes (rWCU), Streams reads, DAX billed separately; Standard-IA table class lowers storage fees. <strong>AWS lock-in is the biggest commercial reality</strong>: no other cloud, no self-hosting.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__13": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有中文版但部分页面翻译滞后</span><p class=\"snippet\">中等<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。官方文档有中文版但部分页面翻译滞后；中文社区实践帖（CSDN/掘金/知乎）不少，但深度建模（单表设计、GSI 成本）内容多为英文。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有中文版但部分页面翻译滞后</span><p><strong>中等</strong><span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。官方文档有中文版但部分页面翻译滞后；中文社区实践帖（CSDN/掘金/知乎）不少，但深度建模（单表设计、GSI 成本）内容多为英文。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Medium</span><p class=\"snippet\">Medium <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Official docs have a Chinese edition but some pages lag in translation; there are plenty of Chinese community practice posts (CSDN/Juejin/Zh…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Medium</span><p><strong>Medium</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Official docs have a Chinese edition but some pages lag in translation; there are plenty of Chinese community practice posts (CSDN/Juejin/Zhihu), but deep modeling content (single-table design, GSI cost) is mostly in English.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__2": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。CloudTrail 记录管理面 API（建表、改容量、改策略）；数据面（GetItem/PutItem/Query）默认无审计，靠 CloudTrail data events（需单独启用、按量收费）或应用层日志。没有 SQL 审计日志式的&quot;谁查了哪行&quot;开箱能力。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p><strong>部分支持</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。CloudTrail 记录<strong>管理面</strong> API（建表、改容量、改策略）；<strong>数据面</strong>（GetItem/PutItem/Query）默认无审计，靠 CloudTrail data events（需单独启用、按量收费）或应用层日志。没有 SQL 审计日志式的&quot;谁查了哪行&quot;开箱能力。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. CloudTrail records management-plane API calls (table creation, capacity changes, policy changes); the data plane (GetItem/PutItem/Que…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. CloudTrail records <strong>management-plane</strong> API calls (table creation, capacity changes, policy changes); the <strong>data plane</strong> (GetItem/PutItem/Query) has no auditing by default — rely on CloudTrail data events (must be enabled separately, metered billing) or application-layer logging. There is no out-of-the-box &quot;who read which row&quot; SQL-audit-log-style capability.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__3": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。无用户名密码，IAM SigV4 签名；细粒度访问控制（dynamodb:LeadingKeys 行级、dynamodb:Attributes 列级），多租户隔离的标准做法。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。无用户名密码，IAM SigV4 签名；细粒度访问控制（<code>dynamodb:LeadingKeys</code> 行级、<code>dynamodb:Attributes</code> 列级），多租户隔离的标准做法。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No username/password; IAM SigV4 signatures; fine-grained access control (row-level via dynamodb:LeadingKeys, column-level via dynamodb:Attribut…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No username/password; IAM SigV4 signatures; fine-grained access control (row-level via <code>dynamodb:LeadingKeys</code>, column-level via <code>dynamodb:Attributes</code>) — the standard practice for multi-tenant isolation.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__4": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。PITR 连续备份（2025-01 起保留期 1–35 天可配）+ 秒级时间点恢复；on-demand 全量备份（可永久保留）；AWS Backup 集成。关键限制：恢复只能生成新表，不支持原地覆盖/回滚<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>，&quot;回滚到 10 分钟前&quot;意味着切流量到新表。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。PITR 连续备份（2025-01 起保留期 1–35 天可配）+ 秒级时间点恢复；on-demand 全量备份（可永久保留）；AWS Backup 集成。关键限制：<strong>恢复只能生成新表，不支持原地覆盖/回滚</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>，&quot;回滚到 10 分钟前&quot;意味着切流量到新表。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. PITR continuous backups (retention configurable 1–35 days since 2025-01) + second-level point-in-time restore; on-demand full backups (retained…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. PITR continuous backups (retention configurable 1–35 days since 2025-01) + second-level point-in-time restore; on-demand full backups (retained indefinitely); AWS Backup integration. Key limitation: <strong>recovery only creates a new table — no in-place overwrite/rollback</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. &quot;Roll back to 10 minutes ago&quot; means cutting traffic to a new table.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__5": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（编辑判断）。纯 serverless，无引擎版本、无升级窗口、无停机升级概念；新能力（如向量检索 GA 2026-08）直接可用。代价是行为变更不由你控制发布时间。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p><strong>不适用</strong>（编辑判断）。纯 serverless，无引擎版本、无升级窗口、无停机升级概念；新能力（如向量检索 GA 2026-08）直接可用。代价是行为变更不由你控制发布时间。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Not applicable</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not applicable (editorial judgment). Pure serverless: no engine versions, no upgrade windows, no downtime-upgrade concept; new capabilities (e.g., vector search GA 2026-0…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Not applicable</span><p><strong>Not applicable</strong> (editorial judgment). Pure serverless: no engine versions, no upgrade windows, no downtime-upgrade concept; new capabilities (e.g., vector search GA 2026-08) are simply available. The cost: you don&#x27;t control when behavior changes ship.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__6": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。CloudWatch 指标（ConsumedRCU/WCU、ThrottledRequests、ReplicationLatency、SystemErrors 等）；Contributor Insights 定位热 key/热分区；CloudTrail；DAX 有独立指标。慢查询概念不存在——只有&quot;被节流的请求&quot;。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。CloudWatch 指标（ConsumedRCU/WCU、ThrottledRequests、ReplicationLatency、SystemErrors 等）；Contributor Insights 定位热 key/热分区；CloudTrail；DAX 有独立指标。慢查询概念不存在——只有&quot;被节流的请求&quot;。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. CloudWatch metrics (ConsumedRCU/WCU, ThrottledRequests, ReplicationLatency, SystemErrors, etc.); Contributor Insights to locate hot keys/hot pa…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. CloudWatch metrics (ConsumedRCU/WCU, ThrottledRequests, ReplicationLatency, SystemErrors, etc.); Contributor Insights to locate hot keys/hot partitions; CloudTrail; DAX has its own metrics. The concept of &quot;slow queries&quot; doesn&#x27;t exist — only &quot;throttled requests.&quot;</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__7": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。HTTPS API，无连接、无连接池——连接风暴问题天然不存在；但&quot;连接&quot;换成了&quot;吞吐配额&quot;，突发超 2 倍历史峰值 30 分钟内仍可能被节流（社区技能文档口径）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。HTTPS API，无连接、无连接池——连接风暴问题天然不存在；但&quot;连接&quot;换成了&quot;吞吐配额&quot;，突发超 2 倍历史峰值 30 分钟内仍可能被节流（社区技能文档口径）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. HTTPS API, no connections, no connection pools — connection storms are a non-issue by construction. But &quot;connections&quot; are replaced by &quot;throughp…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. HTTPS API, no connections, no connection pools — connection storms are a non-issue by construction. But &quot;connections&quot; are replaced by &quot;throughput quotas&quot;: bursts exceeding 2x the historical peak can still be throttled within 30 minutes (community skill docs wording).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。TransactWriteItems（最多 100 项/4MB，2x WCU）、TransactGetItems（最多 100 项/4MB）；ClientRequestToken 幂等；单 Region 内 ACID。限制：事务仅单 Region（MRSC Global Tables 不支持事务）；默认读最终一致，Cons…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。<code>TransactWriteItems</code>（最多 100 项/4MB，<strong>2x WCU</strong>）、<code>TransactGetItems</code>（最多 100 项/4MB）；<code>ClientRequestToken</code> 幂等；单 Region 内 ACID。限制：事务仅单 Region（MRSC Global Tables 不支持事务）；默认读最终一致，<code>ConsistentRead=True</code> 得强一致（2x RCU）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. TransactWriteItems (max 100 items / 4MB, 2x WCU), TransactGetItems (max 100 items / 4MB); ClientRequestToken for idempotency; ACID within a sin…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. <code>TransactWriteItems</code> (max 100 items / 4MB, <strong>2x WCU</strong>), <code>TransactGetItems</code> (max 100 items / 4MB); <code>ClientRequestToken</code> for idempotency; ACID within a single region. Limitations: transactions are single-region only (MRSC Global Tables don&#x27;t support transactions); reads are eventually consistent by default — <code>ConsistentRead=True</code> gets strong consistency (2x RCU).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__9": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。表内 3 AZ 同步复制；读默认最终一致（通常 &lt;1 秒收敛，厂商口径）；跨 Region Global Tables：MREC（异步，last-writer-wins）或 MRSC（同步 quorum，需 3 Region 固定拓扑）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。表内 3 AZ 同步复制；读默认最终一致（通常 &lt;1 秒收敛，厂商口径）；跨 Region Global Tables：MREC（异步，last-writer-wins）或 MRSC（同步 quorum，需 3 Region 固定拓扑）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. 3-AZ synchronous replication within a table; reads default to eventual consistency (usually converging in &lt;1 second — vendor claim); cross-regi…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. 3-AZ synchronous replication within a table; reads default to eventual consistency (usually converging in &lt;1 second — vendor claim); cross-region Global Tables: MREC (async, last-writer-wins) or MRSC (synchronous quorum, requires a fixed 3-region topology).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "edb__0": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——EPAS/PGE 15+ 内核级 TDE（数据文件 + WAL + 查询临时文件，对应用透明；密钥可经 PGDATAKEYWRAPCMD/UNWRAPCMD 对接外部 KMS）；initdb 时决定，事后难改。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（2026-09-28 查阅）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong>——EPAS/PGE 15+ 内核级 TDE（数据文件 + WAL + 查询临时文件，对应用透明；密钥可经 PGDATAKEYWRAPCMD/UNWRAPCMD 对接外部 KMS）；initdb 时决定，事后难改。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（2026-09-28 查阅）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — EPAS/PGE 15+ kernel-level TDE (data files + WAL + query temp files, transparent to applications; keys can integrate with external KMS via PGDATAKEYWRAPCMD/UNW…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> — EPAS/PGE 15+ kernel-level TDE (data files + WAL + query temp files, transparent to applications; keys can integrate with external KMS via PGDATAKEYWRAPCMD/UNWRAPCMD); decided at initdb time, hard to change afterwards. Evidence: official docs (reviewed 2026-09-28).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "edb__1": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——TLS/SSL（继承 PG 机制，ssl=on + 证书配置）。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>（PG 机制沿用），官方文档待逐项复核。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong>——TLS/SSL（继承 PG 机制，<code>ssl=on</code> + 证书配置）。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>（PG 机制沿用），官方文档待逐项复核。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — TLS/SSL (inherits the PG mechanism, ssl=on + certificate configuration). Evidence: community consensus (PG mechanism carried over), official docs pending item…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> — TLS/SSL (inherits the PG mechanism, <code>ssl=on</code> + certificate configuration). Evidence: community consensus (PG mechanism carried over), official docs pending item-by-item re-verification.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "edb__10": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持——纵向扩展 + 读副本/分区表为主；PGD 提供多主写入扩展，但语义代价高（见深水区八）。证据：官方口径 + 第三方分析。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p><strong>部分支持</strong>——纵向扩展 + 读副本/分区表为主；PGD 提供多主写入扩展，但语义代价高（见深水区八）。证据：官方口径 + 第三方分析。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported — vertical scaling + read replicas/partitioned tables as the main approaches; PGD offers multi-master write scaling at high semantic cost (see Deep Di…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> — vertical scaling + read replicas/partitioned tables as the main approaches; PGD offers multi-master write scaling at high semantic cost (see Deep Dive 8). Evidence: vendor claim + third-party analysis.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "edb__11": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——PostgreSQL 协议/生态兼容；EPAS 另有 Oracle 兼容模式（SPL、Oracle 数据类型/SQL/数据字典视图、MERGE、OCI/OCL 互操作），语义缺口见深水区一、二。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong>——PostgreSQL 协议/生态兼容；EPAS 另有 Oracle 兼容模式（SPL、Oracle 数据类型/SQL/数据字典视图、MERGE、OCI/OCL 互操作），语义缺口见深水区一、二。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — PostgreSQL protocol/ecosystem compatible; EPAS additionally offers an Oracle compatibility mode (SPL, Oracle data types/SQL/data-dictionary views, MERGE, OCI/…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> — PostgreSQL protocol/ecosystem compatible; EPAS additionally offers an Oracle compatibility mode (SPL, Oracle data types/SQL/data-dictionary views, MERGE, OCI/OCL interop); semantic gaps: see Deep Dives 1–2. Evidence: official docs.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "edb__12": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（商业订阅）</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（商业订阅）——按 uniCore（物理核或分配给 VM 的 vCore/vCPU）或 Server 计量，以订单为准；非永久授权，订阅到期即失去商业软件使用权。当前公开材料未发现可靠统一标价，按惯例询价。证据：EDB 现行订阅协议（2026-09-28 查阅，官方口径）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（商业订阅）</span><p><strong>有（商业订阅）</strong>——按 <code>uniCore</code>（物理核或分配给 VM 的 vCore/vCPU）或 <code>Server</code> 计量，以订单为准；非永久授权，订阅到期即失去商业软件使用权。<strong>当前公开材料未发现可靠统一标价，按惯例询价。</strong>证据：EDB 现行订阅协议（2026-09-28 查阅，官方口径）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (commercial subscription) — metered in uniCore (physical cores or vCores/vCPUs allocated to VMs) or Server units, per the order form; not a perpetual license — …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported (commercial subscription)</strong> — metered in <code>uniCore</code> (physical cores or vCores/vCPUs allocated to VMs) or <code>Server</code> units, per the order form; not a perpetual license — commercial software rights lapse when the subscription expires. <strong>No reliable unified list price found in current public materials; expect quote-based pricing.</strong> Evidence: EDB&#x27;s current subscription agreement (reviewed 2026-09-28, vendor claim).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "edb__13": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持——官方文档以英文为主；国内社区实践内容明显少于 MySQL / OceanBase。证据：编辑判断（待规模化采集验证）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p><strong>部分支持</strong>——官方文档以英文为主；国内社区实践内容明显少于 MySQL / OceanBase。证据：编辑判断（待规模化采集验证）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported — official docs are primarily in English; domestic community practice content is clearly sparser than for MySQL / OceanBase. Evidence: editorial judgm…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> — official docs are primarily in English; domestic community practice content is clearly sparser than for MySQL / OceanBase. Evidence: editorial judgment (pending scaled collection verification).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "edb__2": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——edb_audit（xml/csv 输出）+ edb_audit_statement（ddl/dml/select/set/rollback/error 可按库/角色/库+角色粒度配置）+ edb_audit_connect/disconnect 完整审计参数体系。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（EPAS 13/14 审计日志章节，厂商口径）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong>——<code>edb_audit</code>（xml/csv 输出）+ <code>edb_audit_statement</code>（ddl/dml/select/set/rollback/error 可按库/角色/库+角色粒度配置）+ <code>edb_audit_connect/disconnect</code> 完整审计参数体系。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（EPAS 13/14 审计日志章节，厂商口径）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — edb_audit (xml/csv output) + edb_audit_statement (ddl/dml/select/set/rollback/error configurable at database/role/database+role granularity) + edb_audit_conne…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> — <code>edb_audit</code> (xml/csv output) + <code>edb_audit_statement</code> (ddl/dml/select/set/rollback/error configurable at database/role/database+role granularity) + <code>edb_audit_connect/disconnect</code> — a complete audit parameter system. Evidence: official docs (EPAS 13/14 audit logging chapters, vendor claim).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "edb__3": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——继承 PG 认证体系（密码/SCRAM/证书/LDAP 等 via pg_hba）与角色权限模型；EPAS 专有增强（password_profiles 等）的完整矩阵未独立验证。证据：社区共识 + 待验证。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong>——继承 PG 认证体系（密码/SCRAM/证书/LDAP 等 via pg_hba）与角色权限模型；<strong>EPAS 专有增强（password_profiles 等）的完整矩阵未独立验证</strong>。证据：社区共识 + 待验证。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — inherits the PG authentication system (password/SCRAM/certificate/LDAP etc. via pg_hba) and the role permission model; the complete matrix of EPAS-specific en…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> — inherits the PG authentication system (password/SCRAM/certificate/LDAP etc. via pg_hba) and the role permission model; <strong>the complete matrix of EPAS-specific enhancements (e.g., password_profiles) has not been independently verified</strong>. Evidence: community consensus + to-be-verified.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "edb__4": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——物理备份（pgBackRest/Barman；BART 在 PG/EPAS 14+ 已退役）+ 逻辑备份 + WAL 归档 PITR；对 TDE 需按 pgBackRest 官方文档调参（关 archive-header-check 与 checksum-page）。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> + pgBackRest 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong>——物理备份（pgBackRest/Barman；BART 在 PG/EPAS 14+ 已退役）+ 逻辑备份 + WAL 归档 PITR；对 TDE 需按 pgBackRest 官方文档调参（关 <code>archive-header-check</code> 与 <code>checksum-page</code>）。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> + pgBackRest 官方文档。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — physical backups (pgBackRest/Barman; BART is retired on PG/EPAS 14+) + logical backups + WAL-archiving PITR; for TDE, parameters must be tuned per pgBackRest&#x27;…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> — physical backups (pgBackRest/Barman; BART is retired on PG/EPAS 14+) + logical backups + WAL-archiving PITR; for TDE, parameters must be tuned per pgBackRest&#x27;s official docs (disable <code>archive-header-check</code> and <code>checksum-page</code>). Evidence: official docs + pgBackRest official docs.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "edb__5": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持——pg_upgrade（--link 硬链接，停机分钟级）；逻辑复制平滑切换；dump/restore。商业增强本身可成为升级 blocker（PGE 18.2.0 password_profiles 致 pg_upgrade 失败个案）；无官方原地回退（继承 PG，查证为无）。证据：官方 release notes<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p><strong>部分支持</strong>——<code>pg_upgrade</code>（<code>--link</code> 硬链接，停机分钟级）；逻辑复制平滑切换；dump/restore。商业增强本身可成为升级 blocker（PGE 18.2.0 password_profiles 致 pg_upgrade 失败个案）；<strong>无</strong>官方原地回退（继承 PG，查证为无）。证据：官方 release notes<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>+ 社区共识。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported — pg_upgrade (--link hard links, minutes of downtime); logical-replication cutover; dump/restore. Commercial enhancements can themselves become upgrad…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> — <code>pg_upgrade</code> (<code>--link</code> hard links, minutes of downtime); logical-replication cutover; dump/restore. Commercial enhancements can themselves become upgrade blockers (PGE 18.2.0 case: password_profiles broke pg_upgrade); <strong>no</strong> official in-place rollback (inherited from PG, confirmed absent). Evidence: official release notes <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> + community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "edb__6": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——PEM（Postgres Enterprise Manager）商业管控平台；继承 PG pg_stat_* 视图族与 pg_stat_statements。用户反馈默认监控能力仍不足（PeerSpot）。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> + 用户评价。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong>——PEM（Postgres Enterprise Manager）商业管控平台；继承 PG <code>pg_stat_*</code> 视图族与 <code>pg_stat_statements</code>。用户反馈默认监控能力仍不足（PeerSpot）。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> + 用户评价。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — PEM (Postgres Enterprise Manager) commercial management platform; inherits the PG pg_stat_* view family and pg_stat_statements. Users report default monitorin…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> — PEM (Postgres Enterprise Manager) commercial management platform; inherits the PG <code>pg_stat_*</code> view family and <code>pg_stat_statements</code>. Users report default monitoring is still insufficient (PeerSpot). Evidence: vendor claim + user reviews.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "edb__7": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——继承 PG 进程模型（每连接一个后端 OS 进程），高并发需池化（深水区五）；EDB 官方安装介质自带 pgBouncer 包（ppaspgbouncer16），PEM 有 pgBouncer 配置指南。证据：官方安装指南<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>+ 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong>——继承 PG 进程模型（每连接一个后端 OS 进程），高并发需池化（深水区五）；EDB 官方安装介质自带 pgBouncer 包（<code>ppaspgbouncer16</code>），PEM 有 pgBouncer 配置指南。证据：官方安装指南<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>+ 社区共识。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — inherits the PG process model (one backend OS process per connection); high concurrency needs pooling (Deep Dive 5); EDB&#x27;s official installation media ships a…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> — inherits the PG process model (one backend OS process per connection); high concurrency needs pooling (Deep Dive 5); EDB&#x27;s official installation media ships a pgBouncer package (<code>ppaspgbouncer16</code>), and PEM has a pgBouncer configuration guide. Evidence: official installation guide <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> + community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "edb__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——单机 EPAS 继承 PostgreSQL 的 MVCC 与三档隔离级别（Read Committed/Repeatable Read/Serializable）；DDL 事务性同 PG。PGD 多主为最终一致语义，不是跨节点强一致事务的替代品。证据：PG 社区共识 + 官方口径。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong>——单机 EPAS 继承 PostgreSQL 的 MVCC 与三档隔离级别（Read Committed/Repeatable Read/Serializable）；DDL 事务性同 PG。PGD 多主为最终一致语义，<strong>不是</strong>跨节点强一致事务的替代品。证据：PG 社区共识 + 官方口径。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — single-node EPAS inherits PostgreSQL&#x27;s MVCC and three isolation levels (Read Committed/Repeatable Read/Serializable); DDL is transactional as in PG. PGD multi…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> — single-node EPAS inherits PostgreSQL&#x27;s MVCC and three isolation levels (Read Committed/Repeatable Read/Serializable); DDL is transactional as in PG. PGD multi-master uses eventual-consistency semantics and is <strong>not</strong> a substitute for cross-node strongly consistent transactions. Evidence: PG community consensus + vendor claim.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "edb__9": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——流复制主备（EFM 管理自动故障转移）；逻辑复制；PGD 多主（异步/最终收敛，带冲突管理）。证据：官方口径 + 第三方分析。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong>——流复制主备（EFM 管理自动故障转移）；逻辑复制；PGD 多主（异步/最终收敛，带冲突管理）。证据：官方口径 + 第三方分析。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — streaming-replication primary/standby (EFM-managed automatic failover); logical replication; PGD multi-master (async/eventual convergence with conflict manage…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> — streaming-replication primary/standby (EFM-managed automatic failover); logical replication; PGD multi-master (async/eventual convergence with conflict management). Evidence: vendor claim + third-party analysis.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__0": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无（查证为无）</span><p class=\"snippet\">etcd 本体不提供任何静态加密：bbolt 数据文件、WAL、快照文件均为明文落盘。Kubernetes SIG 2019 年安全审计明确写&quot;not encrypted at rest&quot;，加密职责上移到 kube-apiserver 层的 EncryptionConfiguration（aescbc/aesgcm/KMS v2 插件）。…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无（查证为无）</span><p>etcd 本体<strong>不提供任何静态加密</strong>：bbolt 数据文件、WAL、快照文件均为明文落盘。Kubernetes SIG 2019 年安全审计明确写&quot;not encrypted at rest&quot;，加密职责上移到 kube-apiserver 层的 EncryptionConfiguration（aescbc/aesgcm/KMS v2 插件）。 <strong>选型含义</strong>：把 etcd 当通用 KV 用、且数据敏感时，必须自己在应用层加密或依赖磁盘加密；<code>etcdctl snapshot save</code> 产出的快照是明文 bbolt 文件，备份外泄=数据外泄。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">None</span><p class=\"snippet\">etcd itself provides no data-at-rest encryption whatsoever: bbolt data files, WAL, and snapshot files are all written in plaintext. The 2019 Kubernetes SIG security audit…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">None</span><p>etcd itself provides <strong>no data-at-rest encryption whatsoever</strong>: bbolt data files, WAL, and snapshot files are all written in plaintext. The 2019 Kubernetes SIG security audit explicitly states &quot;not encrypted at rest&quot;; encryption duty moves up to the kube-apiserver-layer EncryptionConfiguration (aescbc/aesgcm/KMS v2 plugins). <strong>Selection implication</strong>: if you use etcd as a general-purpose KV store and the data is sensitive, you must encrypt at the application layer yourself or rely on disk encryption; snapshots produced by <code>etcdctl snapshot save</code> are plaintext bbolt files — a leaked backup means leaked data.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__1": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">client 与 peer 通信均可配置 TLS，可开 mTLS（--client-cert-auth，以客户端证书 CN 作为用户名参与认证）。v3.6.13/3.6.14 连续修复了 CRL 绕过（GHSA-3wh4-j44w-pg92）与 TLS 握手无 deadline 导致 goroutine 耗尽的 DoS（GHSA-6vch…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p>client 与 peer 通信均可配置 TLS，可开 mTLS（<code>--client-cert-auth</code>，以客户端证书 CN 作为用户名参与认证）。v3.6.13/3.6.14 连续修复了 CRL 绕过（GHSA-3wh4-j44w-pg92）与 TLS 握手无 deadline 导致 goroutine 耗尽的 DoS（GHSA-6vch-q96h-7gc3）。 <strong>机制一句话</strong>：Go 标准 TLS 栈，证书热加载支持有限，生产必须配齐双向 TLS，否则&quot;拿到证书=拿到全部数据&quot;。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes｜official docs</span><p class=\"snippet\">Both client and peer communication can be configured with TLS, and mTLS is available (--client-cert-auth, using the client certificate CN as the username in authenticatio…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes｜official docs</span><p>Both client and peer communication can be configured with TLS, and mTLS is available (<code>--client-cert-auth</code>, using the client certificate CN as the username in authentication). v3.6.13/v3.6.14 fixed two consecutive issues: a CRL bypass (GHSA-3wh4-j44w-pg92) and a DoS where a TLS handshake without a deadline could exhaust goroutines (GHSA-6vch-q96h-7gc3). <strong>Mechanism in one line</strong>: Go standard TLS stack with limited certificate hot-reload support; production must configure mutual TLS completely, otherwise &quot;having the certificate = having all the data&quot;.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__10": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无分片、无横向写扩展</span><p class=\"snippet\">官方推荐 3 或 5 成员，最多 7（再多收益递减、延迟上升）；无分片、无横向写扩展——加成员不增加写吞吐，反而增加 quorum 延迟。扩容=加成员（在线，经 learner），是可用性扩容不是容量扩容。容量靠纵向：调大 --quota-backend-bytes（默认 2GB，建议上限 8GB，超 8GB 启动告警）。部分支持。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无分片、无横向写扩展</span><p>官方推荐 <strong>3 或 5 成员</strong>，最多 7（再多收益递减、延迟上升）；<strong>无分片、无横向写扩展</strong>——加成员不增加写吞吐，反而增加 quorum 延迟。扩容=加成员（在线，经 learner），是可用性扩容不是容量扩容。容量靠纵向：调大 <code>--quota-backend-bytes</code>（默认 2GB，建议上限 8GB，超 8GB 启动告警）。<strong>部分支持</strong>。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Official recommendation is 3 or 5 members, at most 7 (diminishing returns and rising latency beyond that); no sharding, no horizontal write scaling — adding members does …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p>Official recommendation is <strong>3 or 5 members</strong>, at most 7 (diminishing returns and rising latency beyond that); <strong>no sharding, no horizontal write scaling</strong> — adding members does not increase write throughput, it increases quorum latency. Expanding = adding members (online, via learner); this is availability scaling, not capacity scaling. Capacity comes vertically: raise <code>--quota-backend-bytes</code> (default 2GB, recommended upper limit 8GB, startup warns above 8GB). <strong>Partially supported</strong>.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__11": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（v3 API 稳定；v2 已移除）</span><p class=\"snippet\">v3 gRPC API 为稳定接口；v2 API/v2store 在 3.6 被移除（--enable-v2 删除，残留非成员数据会拒绝启动），3.7 彻底删除 v2 代码。客户端生态：Go clientv3（官方）、Java jetcd、Python（python-etcd3 等）、Node microsoft/etcd3、Rust e…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（v3 API 稳定；v2 已移除）</span><p>v3 gRPC API 为稳定接口；v2 API/v2store 在 3.6 被移除（<code>--enable-v2</code> 删除，残留非成员数据会拒绝启动），3.7 彻底删除 v2 代码。客户端生态：Go clientv3（官方）、Java jetcd、Python（python-etcd3 等）、Node microsoft/etcd3、Rust etcd-client。 <strong>迁移注意</strong>：3.5→3.6 混跑期间以 3.5 特性集为准；K8s apiserver 对 etcd 3.5/3.6 均有支持矩阵要求（以 K8s 官方矩阵为准，待验证具体版本对应）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">The v3 gRPC API is the stable interface; v2 API/v2store were removed in 3.6 (--enable-v2 deleted; residual non-member data refuses to start), and v2 code was fully delete…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p>The v3 gRPC API is the stable interface; v2 API/v2store were removed in 3.6 (<code>--enable-v2</code> deleted; residual non-member data refuses to start), and v2 code was fully deleted in 3.7. Client ecosystem: Go clientv3 (official), Java jetcd, Python (python-etcd3, etc.), Node microsoft/etcd3, Rust etcd-client. <strong>Migration note</strong>: during the 3.5→3.6 mixed-version period, the 3.5 feature set applies; Kubernetes apiserver has support-matrix requirements for etcd 3.5/3.6 (per the official Kubernetes matrix — exact version mapping to-be-verified).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__12": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（纯开源）</span><p class=\"snippet\">Apache-2.0，CNCF 毕业项目，无官方商业版、无功能阉割。商业模式=云厂商托管 K8s 内含 + 生态公司运维支持。 选型含义：不存在&quot;企业版才有 TDE/审计&quot;这类差异，缺的能力是真缺，不是付费能解锁的。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（纯开源）</span><p>Apache-2.0，CNCF 毕业项目，<strong>无官方商业版、无功能阉割</strong>。商业模式=云厂商托管 K8s 内含 + 生态公司运维支持。 <strong>选型含义</strong>：不存在&quot;企业版才有 TDE/审计&quot;这类差异，缺的能力是真缺，不是付费能解锁的。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">Apache-2.0, CNCF-graduated project, no official commercial edition, no feature crippling. Business model = bundled with cloud vendors&#x27; managed Kubernetes + operations sup…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p>Apache-2.0, CNCF-graduated project, <strong>no official commercial edition, no feature crippling</strong>. Business model = bundled with cloud vendors&#x27; managed Kubernetes + operations support from ecosystem companies. <strong>Selection implication</strong>: there is no such thing as &quot;enterprise edition unlocks TDE/auditing&quot; — capabilities that are missing are genuinely missing, not paywalled.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__13": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">中等偏低｜<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></span><p class=\"snippet\">官方文档英文为主；有社区中文翻译项目但版本滞后；中文博客/书籍多集中在&quot;K8s 运维中的 etcd&quot;（备份、compact、调优），对其 Raft/MVCC 源码级机制的中文深度资料少。低于 MySQL/PG/Redis 的中文生态。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">中等偏低｜<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></span><p>官方文档英文为主；有社区中文翻译项目但版本滞后；中文博客/书籍多集中在&quot;K8s 运维中的 etcd&quot;（备份、compact、调优），对其 Raft/MVCC 源码级机制的中文深度资料少。<strong>低于</strong> MySQL/PG/Redis 的中文生态。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Medium-low｜communi</span><p class=\"snippet\">Official docs are primarily in English; there are community Chinese translation projects but they lag versions; Chinese blogs/books mostly focus on &quot;etcd in Kubernetes op…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Medium-low｜communi</span><p>Official docs are primarily in English; there are community Chinese translation projects but they lag versions; Chinese blogs/books mostly focus on &quot;etcd in Kubernetes operations&quot; (backup, compact, tuning), with few Chinese-language deep materials on Raft/MVCC source-level internals. <strong>Below</strong> the Chinese ecosystem of MySQL/PG/Redis.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__2": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无（查证为无）</span><p class=\"snippet\">etcd server 自身没有审计日志功能：谁在何时读写了哪个 key，etcd 不记录。K8s 场景的审计靠 kube-apiserver 的 audit log。 选型含义：合规要求操作留痕时，etcd 只能依赖前置代理/网关或主机层审计，原生能力是空白。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无（查证为无）</span><p>etcd server 自身<strong>没有审计日志功能</strong>：谁在何时读写了哪个 key，etcd 不记录。K8s 场景的审计靠 kube-apiserver 的 audit log。 <strong>选型含义</strong>：合规要求操作留痕时，etcd 只能依赖前置代理/网关或主机层审计，原生能力是空白。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">no audit-logging functionality</span><p class=\"snippet\">The etcd server itself has no audit-logging functionality: who read or wrote which key at what time is not recorded by etcd. In Kubernetes scenarios, auditing relies on k…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-no\">no audit-logging functionality</span><p>The etcd server itself has <strong>no audit-logging functionality</strong>: who read or wrote which key at what time is not recorded by etcd. In Kubernetes scenarios, auditing relies on kube-apiserver&#x27;s audit log. <strong>Selection implication</strong>: when compliance requires an audit trail of operations, etcd can only rely on a front proxy/gateway or host-level auditing — native capability is a blank.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__3": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">有 RBAC：user/role 模型，权限粒度为 key 范围（range）读写，认证方式为密码或 TLS 客户端证书 CN；root 用户为超级用户，需先建 root 再 etcdctl auth enable。 缺口：① 默认关闭，K8s 默认部署也不启用（靠网络隔离+证书）；② 粒度只到 key 前缀，无字段级、无行级；③ 无 L…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p>有 RBAC：user/role 模型，权限粒度为 <strong>key 范围（range）读写</strong>，认证方式为密码或 TLS 客户端证书 CN；<code>root</code> 用户为超级用户，需先建 root 再 <code>etcdctl auth enable</code>。 <strong>缺口</strong>：① 默认关闭，K8s 默认部署也不启用（靠网络隔离+证书）；② 粒度只到 key 前缀，无字段级、无行级；③ 无 LDAP/OIDC 原生集成；④ 权限绕过出过 CVE（嵌套 Txn 绕过 RBAC 检查 CVE-2026-33343，v3.5.28 修复；watch 越权 GHSA-xg4h-6gfc-h4m8，v3.6.14 修复）。 <strong>机制一句话</strong>：鉴权在 v3rpc 层按 key range 做允许/拒绝判断，简单但粗。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Has RBAC: user/role model, permission granularity at key range read/write, authentication via password or TLS client-certificate CN; the root user is the superuser, requi…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p>Has RBAC: user/role model, permission granularity at <strong>key range read/write</strong>, authentication via password or TLS client-certificate CN; the <code>root</code> user is the superuser, requiring root to be created first and then <code>etcdctl auth enable</code>. <strong>Gaps</strong>: ① disabled by default, and not enabled in default Kubernetes deployments either (relying on network isolation + certificates); ② granularity only reaches key prefixes — no field-level, no row-level; ③ no native LDAP/OIDC integration; ④ authorization bypasses have had CVEs (nested Txn bypassing RBAC checks, CVE-2026-33343, fixed in v3.5.28; watch privilege escalation GHSA-xg4h-6gfc-h4m8, fixed in v3.6.14). <strong>Mechanism in one line</strong>: authorization does allow/deny decisions per key range at the v3rpc layer — simple but coarse.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__4": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">备份：etcdctl snapshot save 在线对单成员取一致性快照。恢复：v3.6 起 etcdctl snapshot restore/status 已移除，改由 etcdutl 承担离线恢复；恢复本质是停机重建——用快照起一个新集群（或作为新成员加入），不支持在线单 key/表级恢复、不支持 PITR。恢复速度取决于快照大小与…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p>备份：<code>etcdctl snapshot save</code> 在线对单成员取一致性快照。恢复：v3.6 起 <code>etcdctl snapshot restore/status</code> 已移除，改由 <strong><code>etcdutl</code></strong> 承担离线恢复；恢复本质是<strong>停机重建</strong>——用快照起一个新集群（或作为新成员加入），不支持在线单 key/表级恢复、不支持 PITR。恢复速度取决于快照大小与成员重放 WAL 的速度。 <strong>机制一句话</strong>：快照=bbolt 文件拷贝级备份，恢复=重建集群，没有逻辑备份/增量备份概念。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Backup: etcdctl snapshot save takes a consistent snapshot online against a single member. Restore: starting with v3.6, etcdctl snapshot restore/status was removed and off…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p>Backup: <code>etcdctl snapshot save</code> takes a consistent snapshot online against a single member. Restore: starting with v3.6, <code>etcdctl snapshot restore/status</code> was removed and offline restore is now handled by <strong><code>etcdutl</code></strong>; restore is fundamentally <strong>downtime rebuild</strong> — bootstrap a new cluster from the snapshot (or join it as a new member); no online single-key/table-level restore, no PITR. Restore speed depends on snapshot size and how fast members replay WAL. <strong>Mechanism in one line</strong>: snapshot = bbolt-file-level-copy backup; restore = rebuild the cluster; there is no notion of logical or incremental backup.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__5": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（滚动升级 + 3.6 起支持降级）</span><p class=\"snippet\">3.5→3.6 为零停机滚动升级（逐个替换成员），官方要求先把 3.5 升到 3.5.32+ 再升 3.6。前置条件：v2store 不得含非成员数据（etcdutl check v2store 检查；--enable-v2 在 3.6 被删除）。 v3.6.0 是首个完整支持降级的版本：etcdctl downgrade validat…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（滚动升级 + 3.6 起支持降级）</span><p>3.5→3.6 为<strong>零停机滚动升级</strong>（逐个替换成员），官方要求先把 3.5 升到 3.5.32+ 再升 3.6。前置条件：v2store 不得含非成员数据（<code>etcdutl check v2store</code> 检查；<code>--enable-v2</code> 在 3.6 被删除）。 <strong>v3.6.0 是首个完整支持降级的版本</strong>：<code>etcdctl downgrade validate/enable 3.5</code> 做数据 schema 回迁后再滚动降级。 <strong>回退成本</strong>：降级是显式两阶段操作，不是&quot;重装旧版就行&quot;（3.6 拒绝跑在更新版本的数据目录上）。另：v3.7 线已发布（v3.7.0 GA 2026-07-08，v2 相关代码彻底删除），3.4 已于 2026 年 6 月停止维护。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">3.5→3.6 is a zero-downtime rolling upgrade (replace members one by one); the official requirement is to upgrade 3.5 to 3.5.32+ before moving to 3.6. Prerequisite: v2store…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p>3.5→3.6 is a <strong>zero-downtime rolling upgrade</strong> (replace members one by one); the official requirement is to upgrade 3.5 to 3.5.32+ before moving to 3.6. Prerequisite: v2store must contain no non-member data (<code>etcdutl check v2store</code> check; <code>--enable-v2</code> was removed in 3.6). <strong>v3.6.0 is the first version with full downgrade support</strong>: <code>etcdctl downgrade validate/enable 3.5</code> performs data-schema migration back before rolling downgrade. <strong>Rollback cost</strong>: downgrade is an explicit two-phase operation — not &quot;just reinstall the old version&quot; (3.6 refuses to run on a data directory from a newer version). Also: the v3.7 line has been released (v3.7.0 GA 2026-07-08, v2-related code fully removed), and 3.4 stopped maintenance in June 2026.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__6": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">/metrics 暴露 Prometheus 指标（--metrics=extensive 开全量：Raft、WAL fsync、mvcc、watcher 等）；etcdctl endpoint health/status 看成员健康与 db 大小；etcdctl check perf 做写入压测；3.6 新增 /livez /ready…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><code>/metrics</code> 暴露 Prometheus 指标（<code>--metrics=extensive</code> 开全量：Raft、WAL fsync、mvcc、watcher 等）；<code>etcdctl endpoint health/status</code> 看成员健康与 db 大小；<code>etcdctl check perf</code> 做写入压测；3.6 新增 <code>/livez</code> <code>/readyz</code>（对齐 K8s 探针语义）与 Kubernetes 风格 feature gates；<code>--enable-pprof</code>；3.6 引入 OpenTelemetry 追踪。 <strong>关键指标</strong>：<code>etcd_disk_wal_fsync_duration_seconds</code> p99（&gt;10ms 即危险）、<code>etcd_server_leader_changes_seen_total</code>、dbSize/dbSizeInUse。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes｜official docs</span><p class=\"snippet\">/metrics exposes Prometheus metrics (--metrics=extensive enables the full set: Raft, WAL fsync, mvcc, watcher, etc.); etcdctl endpoint health/status checks member health …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes｜official docs</span><p><code>/metrics</code> exposes Prometheus metrics (<code>--metrics=extensive</code> enables the full set: Raft, WAL fsync, mvcc, watcher, etc.); <code>etcdctl endpoint health/status</code> checks member health and db size; <code>etcdctl check perf</code> runs write load tests; 3.6 added <code>/livez</code> <code>/readyz</code> (aligned with Kubernetes probe semantics) and Kubernetes-style feature gates; <code>--enable-pprof</code>; 3.6 introduced OpenTelemetry tracing. <strong>Key metrics</strong>: <code>etcd_disk_wal_fsync_duration_seconds</code> p99 (&gt;10ms is dangerous), <code>etcd_server_leader_changes_seen_total</code>, dbSize/dbSizeInUse.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__7": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（gRPC 长连接）</span><p class=\"snippet\">2379 端口 gRPC（HTTP/2 多路复用），单连接承载多 stream；clientv3 支持多 endpoint 配置与 round-robin 负载均衡、断线重连；watch 是长生命周期 server-stream。连接开销低，不需要也不建议应用层连接池（一个 client 实例复用即可）。 注意：watch 数量直接转化为…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（gRPC 长连接）</span><p>2379 端口 gRPC（HTTP/2 多路复用），单连接承载多 stream；clientv3 支持多 endpoint 配置与 round-robin 负载均衡、断线重连；watch 是<strong>长生命周期 server-stream</strong>。连接开销低，不需要也不建议应用层连接池（一个 client 实例复用即可）。 <strong>注意</strong>：watch 数量直接转化为服务端内存与 fanout 开销（见深水区二）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">gRPC on port 2379 (HTTP/2 multiplexing), multiple streams over a single connection; clientv3 supports multi-endpoint configuration with round-robin load balancing and rec…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p>gRPC on port 2379 (HTTP/2 multiplexing), multiple streams over a single connection; clientv3 supports multi-endpoint configuration with round-robin load balancing and reconnect-on-failure; watch is a <strong>long-lived server-stream</strong>. Connection overhead is low — no application-level connection pool is needed or recommended (reuse one client instance). <strong>Note</strong>: watch count translates directly into server-side memory and fanout cost (see deep-dive II).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持（KV 语义的事务）</span><p class=\"snippet\">etcd 的&quot;事务&quot;= Txn：If（多条件比较）/Then/Else 原子执行，单 Raft round-trip 内对多 key 做 CAS（比较维度：value/version/createRevision/modRevision/lease）。 隔离级别：写一律线性一致（经 leader + quorum + WAL fsync）…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持（KV 语义的事务）</span><p>etcd 的&quot;事务&quot;= <strong>Txn：If（多条件比较）/Then/Else 原子执行</strong>，单 Raft round-trip 内对多 key 做 CAS（比较维度：value/version/createRevision/modRevision/lease）。 <strong>隔离级别</strong>：写一律线性一致（经 leader + quorum + WAL fsync）；读分两档——linearizable（默认走 quorum/ReadIndex）与 serializable（leader 本地读，可能读到旧值但不加延迟）。 <strong>没有</strong>多语句交互式事务、没有回滚段、没有关系型意义上的隔离级别矩阵；客户端 STM（如 Go concurrency 包、Node 的 microsoft/etcd3 的 software transactional memory）是<strong>基于 Txn 在客户端拼出的乐观并发</strong>，不等同于服务端事务。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partially supporte</span><p class=\"snippet\">etcd&#x27;s &quot;transaction&quot; = Txn: If (multi-condition comparisons) / Then / Else executed atomically, performing CAS (compare-and-swap) across multiple keys within a single Raf…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partially supporte</span><p>etcd&#x27;s &quot;transaction&quot; = <strong>Txn: If (multi-condition comparisons) / Then / Else executed atomically</strong>, performing CAS (compare-and-swap) across multiple keys within a single Raft round-trip (comparison dimensions: value/version/createRevision/modRevision/lease). <strong>Isolation levels</strong>: all writes are linearizable (via leader + quorum + WAL fsync); reads come in two grades — linearizable (default, goes through quorum/ReadIndex) and serializable (leader local read; may return stale values but adds no latency). <strong>What it doesn&#x27;t have</strong>: multi-statement interactive transactions, no rollback segments, no relational-style isolation-level matrix; client-side STM (e.g., the Go concurrency package, Node&#x27;s microsoft/etcd3 software transactional memory) is <strong>optimistic concurrency assembled client-side on top of Txn</strong> — not equivalent to server-side transactions.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "etcd__9": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Raft（etcd-io/raft 独立库）：所有写经 leader 写 WAL 并 fsync 后复制到多数派才提交；CP 系统，分区时少数派侧写不可用、线性一致读失败，不存在脑裂写。读优化：leader 租约读（lease-based read）避免每次读都走 quorum。成员变更走 Raft conf change，支持 lear…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p>Raft（etcd-io/raft 独立库）：所有写经 leader 写 WAL 并 fsync 后复制到多数派才提交；<strong>CP 系统</strong>，分区时少数派侧写不可用、线性一致读失败，<strong>不存在脑裂写</strong>。读优化：leader 租约读（lease-based read）避免每次读都走 quorum。成员变更走 Raft conf change，支持 <strong>learner</strong>（无投票权、追上日志后转正）实现安全加节点。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes｜official docs</span><p class=\"snippet\">Raft (etcd-io/raft standalone library): all writes go through the leader, are fsynced to WAL, replicated to a majority before committing; CP system — during a partition t…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes｜official docs</span><p>Raft (etcd-io/raft standalone library): all writes go through the leader, are fsynced to WAL, replicated to a majority before committing; <strong>CP system</strong> — during a partition the minority side cannot write and linearizable reads fail; <strong>no split-brain writes can occur</strong>. Read optimization: leader lease-based reads avoid going through quorum for every read. Membership changes go through Raft conf change, with <strong>learner</strong> support (no voting rights, promoted once it catches up on the log) for safely adding nodes.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>"});